{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0412_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0412_1000_031tom", "source_sha256": "9050c24660a6ecf0552778f91a4588f33f901d09aa9119c69ee4a94823feda8c", "ja": "綺麗な海ですね、{$P$}さん。\n今日は気持ちのいいお仕事ができそうですね～♪", "zh": "真美的大海啊，{$P$}先生。\n今天似乎能完成一次令人心情舒畅的工作呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0412_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0412_1001_p", "source_sha256": "01ca901ba4dd6c2a2ed9cea5198e68c78da20bc3a747f69f5d5fee1fd7544f23", "ja": "そうだな。青い海、広い空、水着の朋花……\n最高の組み合わせだ！", "zh": "没错。蔚蓝的大海、广阔的天空，还有穿着泳装的朋花……真是最棒的组合！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0412_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0412_1002_031tom", "source_sha256": "64f6f07fea8cad44b6f6bfa86bf758e7de9590ec4cd487bafb5fa4d2de0491bf", "ja": "……まったく、浮かれていますね～。\nでは、そろそろ私も着替えに行ってきます～。", "zh": "……真是的，您未免也太得意忘形了～\n那我差不多也该去换衣服了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0412_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0412_1003_p", "source_sha256": "5a92ec476faf56121c7347a9be80d06370e17680b267652bd4473d94e8e3a8b1", "ja": "ああ。今日は日差しが強いらしいから、日焼け対策は\nしっかりとな。日焼け止めもちゃんと塗って……。", "zh": "嗯。听说今天阳光很强，防晒措施要做好。防晒霜也要好好涂……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0412_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0412_1004_031tom", "source_sha256": "eb0c168b4dedef347802b9c86126242339d4dedc50e39bfa16bfcefc6463ee53", "ja": "それくらいわかっていますよ～。\n……もしかして、日焼け止め、塗りたいんですか～？", "zh": "这些我当然知道啦～\n……难道说，您想帮我涂防晒霜吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0412_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0412_1005_p", "source_sha256": "51d2bdaaf5b6f600d2d486f8842d39739271c75387b907009c5ee0c9737b232c", "ja": "と、朋花！？", "zh": "诶、朋花！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0412_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0412_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "6894d6b4d67bbb1b4686255ce8c29b09a892332b9042fb821d88bbcadb44cbbc", "ja": "あらあら、そんなに慌てて……。\nますます怪しいですね～、うふふ♪", "zh": "哎呀呀，慌成这个样子……\n真是越来越可疑了呢～，呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0412_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0412_1007_p", "source_sha256": "f0e42ee4e5b4261ff4fcad7a293042bb7d4fb934bd6ec482c0effc18054c9e02", "ja": "うふふ、じゃなくて……。\n別にそういう意味で言ったわけじゃないんだ。", "zh": "别“呵呵”了……\n我也不是那个意思啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0412_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0412_1008_031tom", "source_sha256": "eda81ff5f9044a3fbc1d88ff47963eaec1a37a31fb296e4668190aa6447a6d33", "ja": "ふふ、冗談です。それでは{$P$}さん\n大人しく聖母を待っててくださいね～♪", "zh": "呵呵，开玩笑的。那么，{$P$}先生请乖乖等着圣母哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0412_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0412_1009_p", "source_sha256": "2f7d63dcff338c13deb24e09399e5b02bd84adaabc8f28a2fe3fc15e1289f244", "ja": "（見事にからかわれてしまったな……。でも朋花が\n冗談を言うなんて……少しは浮かれてるのかな？）", "zh": "（被戏弄得真彻底啊……不过，朋花居然会开玩笑……难道她也有点兴奋过头了吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
